### New Year Resolutions API Tests
### Base URL - Using HTTP to avoid SSL certificate issues
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5275
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/resolutions

### 1. Get All Resolutions
GET {{apiUrl}}

### 2. Get All Resolutions - Filter by isDone=false (Active)
GET {{apiUrl}}?isDone=false

### 3. Get All Resolutions - Filter by isDone=true (Completed)
GET {{apiUrl}}?isDone=true

### 4. Get All Resolutions - Search by title
GET {{apiUrl}}?title=walk

### 5. Get All Resolutions - Combined filter (isDone + title search)
GET {{apiUrl}}?isDone=false&title=read

### 6. Get All Resolutions - Invalid isDone value (should return 400)
GET {{apiUrl}}?isDone=invalid

### 7. Get Resolution by ID (valid)
GET {{apiUrl}}/1

### 8. Get Resolution by ID (invalid - id <= 0, should return 400)
GET {{apiUrl}}/0

### 9. Get Resolution by ID (not found - should return 404)
GET {{apiUrl}}/999

### 10. Create New Resolution (valid)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Exercise 30 minutes daily"
}

### 11. Create New Resolution - Empty title (should return 400)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### 12. Create New Resolution - Whitespace title (should return 400)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   "
}

### 13. Create New Resolution - Missing body (should return 400)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 14. Update Resolution (valid)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Walk 30 minutes daily",
  "isDone": true
}

### 15. Update Resolution - ID mismatch (should return 400)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "Walk 30 minutes daily",
  "isDone": true
}

### 16. Update Resolution - Invalid route ID (should return 400)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "title": "Walk 30 minutes daily",
  "isDone": true
}

### 17. Update Resolution - Empty title (should return 400)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "",
  "isDone": true
}

### 18. Update Resolution - Not found (should return 404)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Test",
  "isDone": true
}

### 19. Delete Resolution (valid)
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/2

### 20. Delete Resolution - Invalid ID (should return 400)
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/0

### 21. Delete Resolution - Not found (should return 404)
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/999

